sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Vue/Inertia Subject Form
    participant Controller as SubjectController
    participant DB as Database

    Admin->>UI: Enter subject details
    UI->>Controller: POST /subjects
    Controller->>Controller: Validate StoreSubjectRequest
    Controller->>Controller: Generate join_code and reviewer_code
    Controller->>DB: Insert subjects record
    DB-->>Controller: Subject saved
    Controller-->>UI: Redirect to subject show page
    UI-->>Admin: Display codes and setup actions
